  },
  {
    "id": 2007004010020,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "はいもしもしー",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700401/2007004010020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "すまん！　結華か？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004010030,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "はいはい三峰ですー\r\nどしたのプロデューサー、なんか慌ててる感じ？",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700401/2007004010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや申し訳ない、今ちょっと道に迷ってて……！\r\n多分、時間通りに着けないと思う……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "結華は今どこだ……？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004010040,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "んーと、こっちは今待ち合わせ場所に着いたとこかな",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700401/2007004010040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004010050,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ごめんね、わかりづらいとこ指定しちゃって\r\n駅とかにしといたら良かった",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700401/2007004010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "結華は悪くない！　地図さえあればなんとかなると\r\n思った俺が甘かったんだ……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004010060,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あー……この辺、道も入り組んでるし、\r\n何より土日は人が多いもんねぇ……",
    "charAnim1": "surp3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700401/2007004010060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004010070,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……そだ、プロデューサー、\r\n今いるとこから何が見える？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700401/2007004010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え。……そうだな……大きい交差点と、\r\n化粧品の看板があるビルが見える……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004010080,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "なるほど？\r\nそのビルってプロデューサーから見てどっち側？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700401/2007004010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えっと、交差点を渡って右手側、かな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004010090,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "おっけおっけ、じゃあその交差点渡ってから左ね",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700401/2007004010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004010100,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "しばらく行くとクレープ屋さんがあると思うんだ、\r\n多分路地３本目ぐらい。そしたらその通りに入って？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700401/2007004010100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "すごいな結華、わかるのか……！？\r\nというか、案内してくれるのか……！？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004010110,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ご名答！\r\n安心してナビされちゃっていいよー？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700401/2007004010110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "待たせている上に、申し訳ない……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004010120,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "やだなぁ畏まんないでって！　こういう時こそお互い様！\r\n……それよりほら、足、止まってない？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700401/2007004010120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああすまない！\r\n渡って左だったよな？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004010130,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "そうそう、それで次は──",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700401/2007004010130"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "effectLabel": "black1",
    "effectTarget": {
      "type": "rect",
