  },
  {
    "id": 2007004010140,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "よーしもうちょっと！\r\n後はその道まっすぐ来るだけだよ～",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700401/2007004010140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ありがとう結華……！　助かったよ……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004010150,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "off",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700401/2007004010150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004010160,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ね、プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "010",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700401/2007004010160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004010170,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ここで三峰が動いたら、面白いことになりそうだね？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700401/2007004010170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──え",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004010180,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "逃げる三峰、追うプロデューサー……\r\n壮大な追いかけっこが、今、始まる……！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700401/2007004010180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えええ！？",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "頼む！\r\n合流させてくれ……！",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "もう少しだけ\r\n待ってもらえないか",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "……わかった、\r\n受けて立とう",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004010190,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "おや～？　Ｐたん、必死だねぇ",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700401/2007004010190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そりゃあそうだよ、今結華を見失ったら、\r\nすぐに探し出せる自信ないし……！",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ただでさえ俺が遅れてるせいで結華に迷惑かけてるんだ、\r\nこれ以上時間を使わせるわけにはいかない",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だからお願いだ、そこで待っていてくれないか……！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004010200,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あははっ、もう！\r\nプロデューサーはほんっと真面目だなぁ",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700401/2007004010200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004010210,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "こっちからふざけてるんだから、\r\n三峰への迷惑なんて考えなくたっていいのに",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700401/2007004010210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そういうわけにはいかないよ\r\n……この状況で何言っても説得力ないかもしれないけど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004010220,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "確かに！\r\n絶賛迷子のＰたんが言うと、かっこよさは半減かな？",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700401/2007004010220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004010230,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "でもほら、もう少しでそのデバフもなくなるから安心して？\r\nあ、携帯ショップの通りを右だよ～",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700401/2007004010230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、ありがとう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004010240,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "うん",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700401/2007004010240"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004010250,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "言いつけ守って大人しく待ってるから、\r\n早く来てよねー、プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700401/2007004010250"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004010260,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "少しー？\r\n別にいいけど、ほんとに少しだよー？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700401/2007004010260"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004010270,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "じゅーう、きゅーう、はーち、なーな──",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700401/2007004010270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──見つけた！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bgm": "off"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004010280,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あれっ、プロデューサー！？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700401/2007004010280"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "間に合って良かった……\r\nいや、正確には間に合ってないんだけど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "待たせて悪かった、結華……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004010290,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あーあー、そんな息切らしてまで\r\n走ってこなくても良かったのに……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700401/2007004010290"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004010300,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "大丈夫？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700401/2007004010300"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、ああ……大丈夫だ\r\nとにかく、結華が動き出す前に合流できて良かった……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004010310,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ふふっ、ほんとにもう\r\nまさかここまで一生懸命になってくれるとは思わなかったよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700401/2007004010310"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004010320,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "せっかくのおふざけだったのになぁ\r\nざーんねんっ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
